      "body": "## Motivation\nWith sentence-transformers 6, `test_embedding_models` compares against a wrong HF reference:\n- ST 6 renders plain text through the backbone's chat template, while SGLang embeds the raw text.\n- The non-ST branch builds `models.Transformer` without `is_causal=True`, so gte-Qwen2 runs bidirectionally. The kwarg was renamed (`config_args` to `config_kwargs`) in v6.\n\n## Modifications\n- `test/runners.py`: drop the chat-template (\"message\") modality for ST >= 6; pass `is_causal=True` with the version's kwarg name. No-op for ST < 6.\n- `test_embedding_models.py`: `mem_fraction_static=0.85` on XPU only, so the 8B model has enough KV for the ~6.4k-token prompt on a 24 GB card.\n\nTest-only change.\n\n## Accuracy Tests\n`test_embedding_models::test_prefill_logits` (gte-Qwen2-1.5B, Qwen3-Embedding-8B, e5-mistral-7b) and `test_embedding_encoding_format` pass on Arc Pro B60 with sentence-transformers 6.0.1.\n\n## Speed Tests and Profiling\nN/A (test-only).\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #41800310855](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/41800310855)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #41800310771](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/41800310771)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #41800310767](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/41800310767)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n\n> [!TIP]\n> Base CI only covers the core cases, and its workload may not exercise your change. Use `/rerun-test` to run the tests your change touches, or copy this prompt for an agent:\n>\n> ```text\n> Find the registered tests this PR affects and run them with /rerun-test, following https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/blob/main/.agents/skills/rerun-test/SKILL.md\n> ```\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
